---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
import { url } from '../utils/url';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description={`How ${siteConfig.name} handles information on this website.`}
>
  <section class="border-b border-line bg-surface">
    <div class="shell py-8 sm:py-10">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-display-2">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[0.9rem] text-ink-subtle">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="shell prose-body">
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>
        This website is a set of static pages. There is no account system, no contact form and no
        server that receives your data. We do not run analytics or advertising trackers, and we do not
        set cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
      <p>
        Two features store information locally, on your own device, and nothing is transmitted
        anywhere:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Saved properties.</strong> When you tap the heart on a listing, the property
          reference is kept in your browser's local storage so it is still marked when you return.
          Clearing your browser data removes it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>The property assistant.</strong> The conversation is generated entirely in your
          browser from a fixed script. Your answers are not sent to us or to any third party, and they
          are discarded when you close the page.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we receive when you contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Every enquiry button on this site opens WhatsApp. When you send a message you share your phone
        number and whatever you write with us, and the message passes through WhatsApp, whose own
        privacy terms apply. We use what you send to respond to your enquiry and to look for suitable
        property. We do not sell it or pass it to advertisers.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you follow us on Instagram or Facebook, those platforms handle that interaction under their
        own policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services this site loads</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Fonts</strong> — typefaces are loaded from Google's font servers, which means
          your browser makes a request to Google and Google receives your IP address as part of it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Hosting</strong> — the site is served as static files, and the host's standard server
          logs may record requests.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>Images, scripts and styles are otherwise served from this site itself.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can clear locally stored data at any time through your browser settings. If you have
        contacted us and would like us to delete the conversation and your details from our records,
        message us and we will do it.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this site later adds analytics, a form, or any other data collection, this page will be
        updated before that happens rather than afterwards.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can go to the same WhatsApp number as everything else — see the{' '}
        <a href={url('/contact')}>contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
